.TH GENEEXPRESSION 1 2000-1月 "pattern_representatives" "pattern_representatives"
.SH NAME
pattern_representatives \- get the top n representatives genes in each expression pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIpattern_representatives(\fBpattern\fR as <generic> ExpressionPattern, 
\fBtop\fR as integer = 3);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
get the top n representatives genes in each expression pattern
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBpattern\fB \fR\- 
 an @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.Visualize.ExpressionPattern.ExpressionPattern\fR object of the cmeans clustering result.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtop\fB \fR\- top n cmeans membership items. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a tuple list of the representative gene id set: the slot key of the list is 
 the cluster tag(\fB#1\fR, \fB#2\fR, ...) and the slot value is a character 
 vector of the gene id of the top n members in the corresponding cluster, 
 which is sorted by the membership value in descending order.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
geneExpression
.SH FILES
.PP
phenotype_kit.dll
.PP
